cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tensordir, please cite it using these metadata."
title: tensordir
abstract: >-
  Content-addressed records of labeled tensors in directories: a record is built once from a typed
  spec, stored as zarr, parquet and JSON with provenance, and reopened by key from any process.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Lappalainen
    given-names: Janne K.
keywords:
  - zarr
  - xarray
  - caching
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
references:
