    title: datamate
    url: "https://github.com/flyvis/datamate"
    authors:
      - family-names: Lappalainen
        given-names: Janne K.
    notes: Predecessor of tensordir; its git history is preserved in this repository.
  - type: software
    title: artisan
    url: "https://github.com/MasonMcGill/artisan"
    authors:
      - family-names: McGill
        given-names: Mason
    notes: Predecessor of datamate.
